              "perturb-seq one-gene | adamson et al. 2016",
              "perturb-seq two-gene | norman et al. 2019",
              "sci-plex 3 | 10 um dosage for evaluation nine unseen drugs held out",
              "spatiotemporal single-cell atlas of plasmodium liver stage | afriat et al. 2022"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "method",
            "values": [
              "biolord | deep generative framework with decomposed latent space each known attribute categorical or ordered has a dedicated subnetwork embeddings for categorical mlp encoder for ordered unknown attributes use per-sample embedding with gaussian noise and l2 regularization. generator decoder outputs distribution parameters gaussian zinb or poisson from concatenated latent codes. trained with completeness loss negative log-likelihood + mse and minimality loss l2 penalty on unknown embedding . hyperparameters tuned via weights biases.",
              "biolord-classify | extends biolord with classifiers cross-entropy for categorical attributes and regressors mse for ordered attributes trained jointly to impute missing labels. classification loss added to biolord objective."
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "name",
            "values": [
              "biolord framework and evaluation across tasks"
            ]
